<codeline lineno="34"><highlight class="comment"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="35"><highlight class="comment">This<sp/>class<sp/>takes<sp/>the<sp/>given<sp/>set<sp/>of<sp/>IC&apos;s<sp/>and<sp/>finds<sp/>the<sp/>aircraft<sp/>state<sp/>required<sp/>to</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="36"><highlight class="comment">maintain<sp/>a<sp/>specified<sp/>flight<sp/>condition.<sp/><sp/>This<sp/>flight<sp/>condition<sp/>can<sp/>be</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="37"><highlight class="comment">steady-level<sp/>with<sp/>non-zero<sp/>sideslip,<sp/>a<sp/>steady<sp/>turn,<sp/>a<sp/>pull-up<sp/>or<sp/>pushover.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="38"><highlight class="comment">On-ground<sp/>conditions<sp/>can<sp/>be<sp/>trimmed<sp/>as<sp/>well,<sp/>but<sp/>this<sp/>is<sp/>currently<sp/>limited<sp/>to</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="39"><highlight class="comment">adjusting<sp/>altitude<sp/>and<sp/>pitch<sp/>angle<sp/>only.<sp/>It<sp/>is<sp/>implemented<sp/>using<sp/>an<sp/>iterative,</highlight></codeline>
